`),TU=["","","## Opening externally generated HWP / HWPX files (such as from kordoc MCP)","- For ordinary writing, tables, and formatting in this open Hangul document, prefer the built-in Hangul editor tools (insert_paragraphs, insert_table, style_paragraphs, etc.) so changes happen live with Undo support.","- When the user explicitly asks to use an external generator such as kordoc (e.g. generate_document, fill_form, patch_document, place_seal), save the output .hwpx file inside the system temp folder (never invent arbitrary drive paths) and immediately call open_generated_hwp with that exact file path so the result appears directly in the Hangul editor (loaded into this tab if blank, or opened in a new tab if this tab already has content)."].join(`
